  "ingredients": [
    "1 (8 ounce) box elbow macaroni",
    "0.25 cup butter",
    "0.25 cup all-purpose flour",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "ground black pepper to taste",
    "2 cups milk",
    "2 cups shredded Cheddar cheese"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KzZUo7phRa4Bsra_1V2yFvoUrlA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/23869-simple-macaroni-and-cheese-ddmfs-step01-a59c7635633c47aaa545963b5401b02a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238691/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Cook elbow macaroni in the boiling water, stirring occasionally until tender yet firm to the bite, about 8 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jBC5Y1qwmSX1Pz7eEqxwHUu44So=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/238691-Simple-Macaroni-And-Cheese-mf-Step1_001-f3f1e3416cf742778ac39c1db3d0ebea.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238691/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, melt butter in a saucepan over medium heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rxq90SJQtzOaEl0jAvtytOaZZww=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/238691-Simple-Macaroni-And-Cheese-mf-Step2_002-cff2a9558167448180ac13d7aadb0f64.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238691/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk in flour, salt, and black pepper until smooth, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BXgdxNwF17gAp6CQb67qMPcY8hQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/238691-Simple-Macaroni-And-Cheese-mf-Step3_003-a053939c742147199b60130b0e22f750.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238691/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slowly pour in milk, while constantly stirring; cook and stir until mixture is smooth and bubbling, about 5 minutes, making sure the milk doesn’t burn.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YOhN5cl0H-SjTO-BQWRn_WKpBTk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/238691-Simple-Macaroni-And-Cheese-mf-Step4_004-c60819e1ab6946e89c884ab3fc573536.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238691/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add Cheddar cheese and stir until melted, 2 to 4 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/F0ePI61vokw9PNDuGVWmgGiDkss=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/238691-Simple-Macaroni-And-Cheese-mf-Step5_006-7019c891342041a997f31f04d246e799.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238691/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain macaroni and fold into cheese sauce until coated.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DiRuRRjLwbBLV_VF29TRPZcrC1g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/238691-Simple-Macaroni-And-Cheese-mfs-Step6_007-ea19705a4daa4e1ba37359cda9a70ab6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238691/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve hot and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xI5g0WBP8yPHwRt1Nt5WudTctzE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/238691-Simple-Macaroni-And-Cheese-mfs_008-b32db5aa505041acbe958aedb81d29e9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238691/step_08.webp"
